<title>USA: TABLE - Nabisco Q2 net share higher.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Nabisco Q2 net share higher.</headline>
<dateline>PARSIPPANY, N.J. 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>NABISCO HOLDINGS CORP</p>
<p>			   3 Mos ended 6/30  6 Mos ended 6/30</p>
<p>			 1997	1996	    1997	1996</p>
<p>NET SALES:</p>
